      "writtenOn": "2022-10-19T16:58:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If we return false here the prepareResources call(s) will fail and the snap will fail.\n\nWe could rename this to be \u0027instantiateIfNonVolatile\u0027 to clarify that the Texture isn\u0027t necessarily filled in after this call.\n\nNote that, with volatile promise images, one can\u0027t assume that all TextureProxies have a Texture after snapping.",
      "parentUuid": "f3f4a0dd_84a1feae",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 67,
        "startChar": 19,
        "endLine": 67,
