      "writtenOn": "2022-10-24T14:52:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "instantiate is called in 6 locations - all w/in prepareResources methods. Rather than call instantiate directly we could add a \u0027instantiateOnlyIfNonVolatile\u0027.\n\nThe tri-state return would also work.",
      "parentUuid": "cb44850f_a953839e",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 67,
        "startChar": 19,
        "endLine": 67,
        "endChar": 23
